This crate is a port of the spectrum analyser of the terminus audio
plugin of the evo framework (org.evoframework.audio.terminus, src/fft.rs),
by the same author, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The
window length became a parameter, the input is taken per channel, the peak
hold falls by the hop's own time, a band's level is scaled for the Hann
window's main lobe so a full-scale sine reads one, and the names follow
this workspace.
